深。往矣柰何！當復柰何！」","subject_person_reference_id":"c-songshu-052-xiejingren:p006:r0063","object_person_mention_id":"c-songshu-052-xiejingren:p006:m0061"}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"各端據原句。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null},{"id":"a-song052-xiejingren-spouse6妃","subject_person_id":"lnx_xbi_k90","object_person_id":"4ly_56b_ld0","predicate":"spouse","qualifiers":{"source_term":"廬陵王義真妃","song052_xiejingren_reading":"spouse6妃"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-songshu","book_id":"b-songshu-052","source_id":"s-songshu-052-xiejingren-ws2190655","chapter_id":"c-songshu-052-xiejingren","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-052-xiejingren:p006","quote":"景仁性矜嚴整潔，居宇淨麗，每唾，轉唾左右人衣，事畢，即聽一日澣濯。每欲唾，左右爭來受。高祖雅相重，申以婚姻，廬陵王義真妃，景仁女也。十二年，卒，時年四十七。追贈金紫光祿大夫，加散騎常侍。葬日，高祖親臨，哭之甚慟。與驃騎將軍道憐書曰：「謝景仁殞逝，悲痛摧割，不能自勝。汝聞問惋愕，亦不可堪。其器體淹中，情寄實重，方欲與之共康時務，一旦至此，痛惜兼深。往矣柰何！當復柰何！」","subject_person_reference_id":"c-songshu-052-xiejingren:p006:r0059","object_person_mention_id":"c-songshu-052-xiejingren:p006:m0057"}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"各端據原句。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null}],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[],"mentions":[{"id":"c-songshu-061-yizhen-wife:p002:m0016","start":16,"end":17,"surface":"謝","kind":"person","person_id":"lnx_xbi_k90","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"本傳追復廬陵王封號處稱其母孫修華及其謝妃，兩人各存氏稱。","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-061-yizhen-wife:p002","chapter_id":"c-songshu-061-yizhen-wife"}],"relations":[{"id":"a-song052-xiejingren-father6女","subject_person_id":"lnx_xbi_k90","object_person_id":"684_eaa_511","predicate":"father","qualifiers":{"source_term":"景仁女也","song052_xiejingren_reading":"father6女","lineage":"paternal"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-songshu","book_id":"b-songshu-052","source_id":"s-songshu-052-xiejingren-ws2190655","chapter_id":"c-songshu-052-xiejingren","